BIBE=('Big Bend National Park, run by the National Park Service. The park entrances are open 24 hours a day all year; the entrance '
      'fee is $30 for a private vehicle, good for 7 days, and the park takes cards only, no cash. Dogs are not allowed on any park trail. '
      'Leave everything where it lies: collecting is prohibited.')
